 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "On the desert road to Gaza rolled a chariot in the sun",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "An official of the queen of Ethiopia, a long way he had come",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He was reading from Isaiah, but he could not see the way",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then Philip ran up beside him and he heard the reader say",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like a sheep he was led to the slaughter",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And like a lamb silent before its shearer",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do you understand what you are reading",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "How can I, unless someone guides me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, here is water",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "What is to keep me from being baptized",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, here is water",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.03,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And he went on his way rejoicing",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.48,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Philip began with that passage of Scripture",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.72,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And told him the good news about Jesus",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 2.54,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He ordered the chariot to stop",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 3.15,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And both of them went down into the water",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 4.42,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
